{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121430","id":4064049643,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7yPHnr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121430","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121430.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121430.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121430","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121430/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121430/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121430/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/da4af8e26f30768c13903a147a5052c50e310d0b","number":121430,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `ZIPPacker.compress`","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fully closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12777.\r\n\r\nThis pull request includes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121380 (adds `ZIPReader.decompress`), but doesn't actually depend on it. They are intended to be merged together though.\r\n\r\nImplements `ZIPPacker.compress`.\r\n\r\nYou can use it like this:\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar err: Error = ZIPPacker.compress([\"res://example-output\"], \"res://example-output.zip\",\r\n\tZIPPacker.COMPRESSION_BEST, # Optional parameter\r\n\tZIPPacker.APPEND_CREATE # Optional parameter\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSimilar to the other one, the key advantages of this approach are:\r\n- Much simpler than manually compressing each file\r\n- Does not load each file into memory - writes them in 64KiB chunks instead\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI have tested the pull request works for creating ZIP files, including nested and empty directories.\r\n\r\nDemo: [zip-high-level-demo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30067205/zip-high-level-demo.zip)\r\n\r\n## AI disclosure\r\n\r\nI did not use AI to write the pull request, but I used AI to check my work and identify mistakes.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"log